// The web's half of the listener's conformance (LLP 1133.005 §10, step 2):
// a page cannot listen, so on both web targets the source finds no
// `exactListen` global. `host/web-js/conform.mjs` runs this on the wasm
// host and the JS target; on macOS and Linux the fixture listens instead,
// which `scripts/agent.mjs` drives with a client.

test "on the web the source finds no listener"
  expect state control.status == "no listener on this platform"
  expect text "connections" == "Connections: 0"
